Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 02:55:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Phase 4 part 1: Lead Finder with Opportunity Score and
 compliant outreach

Tenant-scoped prospect lists from the free directory (search code shared
with the legacy Opportunity Radar) or added by hand; queued website
audits with online-booking detection and business-email discovery; an
explained 0-100 Opportunity Score; one-to-one business email outreach
drafted from audit findings and sent by a person, with CAN-SPAM footer,
RFC 8058 one-click unsubscribe, org-wide suppression, 3-touch and daily
limits, and no texting or calling of prospects; convert to CRM; AI tools.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RPZCHpFd1FKcchaeMbmcMV
